  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of the Development Transformations program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Transformations (DevTransform) is a mission-driven, Africa-based, and African-led development organization hosted by the Tax Justice Network Africa. It seeks to transform development practices through the use of data, evidence, analysis, and thought leadership. This grant will support DevTransform&#x2019;s efforts to establish data storytelling labs in Kenya and Uganda that will equip different communities with the skills, strategies, and technical know-how to tell their stories in a more powerful data-centric way, giving a voice to communities and vulnerable and marginalized groups that have been left behind. (Strategy: Evidence-Informed Policymaking)</narrative>
  </description>
